<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1J">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "10">
<configtype typenbr = "3">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C1A36005" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
ISG Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The ISG consists of precision parts. Without taking the following precautions, it may lose its original performance.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Do not disassemble the ISG.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Do not drop or expose the ISG to large shock.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C1A36005001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intake manifold. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1426009"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove accessory drive belt. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1A36004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove nut (1) and disconnect “B” terminal wire (3), and then disconnect ISG connector (4) from ISG (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove ISG upper bolt (5) and lower bolt (6).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove ISG from vehicle.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFKA0P1A2003.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "60.104mm" ver = "02" gw = "207" gh = "154"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove drive belt adjusting arm, if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1626015"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C1A36005002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0C1A36006">ISG Inspection:K12C-ISG</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten ISG upper bolt (5) and lower bolt (6) as follows.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Put ISG (2) on cylinder block and tighten ISG lower bolt temporarily.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten ISG upper bolt to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1J336">
<t-part>
ISG upper bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
30
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
3.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
22.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten ISG lower bolt to 30 N&#183;m (3.1 kgf-m, 22.5 lbf-ft) and check that bushing (7) in ISG bracket is in contact with cylinder block, and then loosen the bolt.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten ISG lower bolt to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1J337">
<t-part>
ISG lower bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
b
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
48
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
4.9
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
35.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Insert lugs (8) of “B” terminal wire (3) into groove (9) and then tighten “B” terminal nut (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1J338">
<t-part>
“B” terminal nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
c
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
11
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
1.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
8.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFKA0P1A2004.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "91.809mm" ver = "01" gw = "221" gh = "244"/>
